        "required": ["body", "buttons"],
        "description": "Linked Devices support up to 10 total buttons and at most 3 CTAs. Replies may be mixed with URL and call buttons using a hydrated template; copy/catalog buttons cannot be mixed with replies. An optional image, video or document header requires exactly one URL or base64 source and cannot be combined with a title. On an official WhatsApp Business number, media headers require an approved template, and at most 3 `reply` buttons are sent; other button types return `501`. There, `body` allows at most 1,024 characters, `title` and `footer` at most 60, and each button needs a unique `id` and a unique `text` of at most 20 characters. Every number also limits each button `id` to 256 UTF-8 bytes. Content outside any limit returns `400`."
      }
